\chapter{Results}
\label{ch:results}

We now present the evaluation results. Two experiments are reported: Experiment~1 tests all strategies under moderate congestion (scale~$0.7$, 50\% control), while Experiment~2 raises the demand and cuts the control budget (scale~$0.85$, 20\% control) to probe generalization. Training dynamics and environmental metrics follow in later sections.

